elli della devozione filiale."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"After several years away, FBI agent Henry Durand returns to find his mother, Marty, a much different person: Having long mourned for Henry's father, she is now embracing single life. One day, while Marty, Henry and his new fiancée, Emily, are out for a walk, they meet Tommy, a mysterious stranger with whom Marty then becomes involved. However, through his FBI contacts, Henry learns that Tommy is suspected of being an art thief. As a young federal agent, Henry is given a difficult assignment: spy on his mother and her boyfriend who is suspected of leading a gang of art thieves.","tagline":"His mom is dating his suspect. Let the surveillance begin."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/i9ku2U9EJX3jmHnzFNXSffT4shg.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ovFR1mMSBHN8tzXA3TlyB865WmO.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":9262,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"en-US","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/i9ku2U9EJX3jmHnzFNXSffT4shg.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/i9ku2U9EJX3jmHnzFNXSffT4shg.jpg","language":"it","width":570,"height":854},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/i9ku2U9EJX3jmHnzFNXSffT4shg.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/i9ku2U9EJX3jmHnzFNXSffT4shg.jpg","language":"it","width":570,"height":854}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7EBefmFo8H6MdmbQ10lTlKXX1DA.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7EBefmFo8H6MdmbQ10lTlKXX1DA.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7EBefmFo8H6MdmbQ10lTlKXX1DA.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7EBefmFo8H6MdmbQ10